---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="About Us | bestfinancecalculator.com"
  description="Learn about our mission to provide lightning-fast, high-performance, and privacy-focused financial calculators."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold font-display tracking-tight text-main-text text-center">
        About Us
      </h1>
      <div class="mt-8 prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-muted-text space-y-6">
        <p>
          <strong>bestfinancecalculator.com</strong> was built by independent developers who were frustrated with slow, bloated, and ad-heavy finance websites that prioritize lead generation over user experience. We believe that getting a quick, accurate mortgage or loan estimate should take seconds, not minutes.
        </p>
        <p>
          Every calculator on this site runs entirely in your browser — no data is ever sent to a server, no account is required, and no financial information is stored. We built this with Astro and vanilla JavaScript specifically to achieve sub-second load times and work even without an internet connection.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our tools are localized for the real-world financial structures of the USA, UK, Canada, Australia, Ireland, and Singapore — because a mortgage in Sydney works very differently from one in London or Chicago.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
